				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-bronzewick" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6376027); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6376027&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605795097" alt="Agent Bronzewick" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6376027)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-bronzewick" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6376027); return false;" >Agent Bronzewick</a></span> <span class="odate time_1588329062 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">01 May 2020 10:31</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4623978">
									

<p>I like it. The story is well paced and kept me interested throughout. The tone is on point. I like the dialogue in the interviews, the characters in them seem real and distinct from one another. This object sounds like one I'd want to have. There's nothing better than a good pot of rice.</p>
<p>I found a couple places where the wording sounds a bit off that could be fixed by adding a word or two.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Foundation agents embedded in local governance were able to confirm the object’s effects, retrieve the object, and issue amnestics to the police</p>
</blockquote>
<p>'issue amnestics to the police' sounds a bit weird to me. I'd suggest changing it to something like 'issue amnestics to the police officers involved'.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Dizon: Greetings Father Pedro. I am Detective Dizon. My department found the police operation at your residence suspicious, and have sent me to interview your side of the story.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>'interview your side of the story' again sounds a bit weird to me. I'd suggesting changing it to something like 'interview you for your side of the story'.</p>
<p>A couple parts where you might want to make small clarifications are.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Paella</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You might want to foot note this too. I live in the US and paella isn't a dish that everyone will know.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Foundation personnel looked into the records of the police station and were able to identify the target of the drug raid, hereby designated as PoI-5246-1.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You might want to add something like 'hereby a person of interested designated PoI-5246-1.' PoI isn't, at least in my experience, a very common abbreviation in SCP articles. You might want to indicate what it means for people who don't know.</p>
<p>Great article. +1</p>

							</div>

								
					
